│ rather than stringizing the macro identifier.                      │
│                                                                    │
│ This means:                                                        │
│                                                                    │
│  • keep the DEF_MNEM(...) definitions as they are                  │
│  • update DEF_MNEM_BIN(NAME) so it refers to the mnemonic value    │
│    variable/string value, not the literal macro name text          │
│                                                                    │
│ If the quoted form is required by the coverage tool, then the      │
│ string value used in the bin must still correspond to the sample   │
│ input. The current quoted macro expansion breaks that              │
│ correspondence.                                                    │
