│ emit quoted bin values to satisfy Verissimo. That made the         │
│ coverpoint expect values like "addi" instead of addi. Since the    │
│ sampled mnemonic values are still unquoted, the simulator treats   │
│ them as unmatched and records them as illegal/default values,      │
│ causing coverage errors and failing tests.                         │
│                                                                    │
│                    2. Where the problem occurs                     │
│                                                                    │
