│                                                                    │
│  • the mnemonic bin macro definition:                              │
│     • DEF_MNEM_BIN(NAME) bins NAME = {"NAME"}                      │
│  • the covergroups that sample mnemonics using mnem_str_t mnemonic │
│    and compare against those bins, for example:                    │
│     • enc_ecall_cg                                                 │
│     • enc_i_cg                                                     │
│     • pairwise_insn_cg                                             │
