1 This is a Verilator-driven graphical simulation of nestang. Should be useful in debugging game / mapper support, among other things.
2 
3 To run the simulation:
4 
5 ```
6 hexdump -ve '1/1 "%02x\n"' game.nes > game.nes.hex
7 # change INES_SIZE in game_data.v to reflect size of game.nes
8 make sim
9 ```
10 
11 You need to set up verilator / libsdl2 with something like:
12 
13 ```
14 # Linux
15 sudo apt install verilator libsdl2-dev
16 
17 # Mac
18 brew install verilator sdl2
19 ```
20
