│    rst_ni) reset branch.                                           │
│  • It is only updated here:                                        │
│                                                                    │
│     rvfi_mode      <= priv_lvl_i;                                  │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ So the buggy behavior is:                                          │
│                                                                    │
│  • reset deasserts,                                                │
│  • rvfi_mode remains unknown,                                      │
│  • RVFI consumers may see invalid privilege mode until the first   │
│    retirement.                                                     │
│                                                                    │
│               3. Best practices to take into account               │
│                                                                    │
│  • All sequential outputs should be given deterministic reset      │
│    values.                                                         │
│  • Formal/debug interface signals should not contain X values      │
│    after reset.                                                    │
│  • Keep the fix minimal and local.                                 │
│  • Use a reset value consistent with the processor’s reset         │
│    privilege mode.                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│                          4. How to fix it                          │
│                                                                    │
│ Initialize rvfi_mode in the reset branch of the sequential block,  │
│ alongside the other RVFI state registers.                          │
│                                                                    │
│ The appropriate reset value is typically user mode encoding for    │
│ RVFI (2'b00) unless the design specifies another reset privilege   │
