│  2 Ensure get_opgroup() includes ADDW in the ADDMUL group          │
│  3 Update the operand selection in src/fpnew_fma_multi.sv so       │
│    operand_c and info_c use either dst_fmt_q or src_fmt_q          │
│    depending on whether the operation is ADD or ADDW               │
