│  • Do not introduce unrelated changes to operation grouping or     │
│    unrelated formats unless needed.                                │
│                                                                    │
│                     4) How to fix the problem                      │
│                                                                    │
│ The cleanest minimal fix is to allow the FMA addend format to be   │
