│     • the operand unpacking section in always_comb begin :         │
│       op_select                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ Specifically, these lines:                                         │
│                                                                    │
│  • operand_c = {fmt_sign[dst_fmt_q][2],                            │
│    fmt_exponent[dst_fmt_q][2], fmt_mantissa[dst_fmt_q][2]};        │
│  • info_c    = info_q[dst_fmt_q][2];                               │
│                                                                    │
│ These force operand C to use the destination format.               │
│                                                                    │
│ The earlier declarations of src_fmt_i / dst_fmt_i and the pipeline │
│ registers are already sufficient; the main functional issue is in  │
│ how operand_c and info_c are selected.                             │
│                                                                    │
