│     • ADDW uses src_fmt_i for operand C                            │
│  3 If needed by the operation-group decoding, ensure ADDW is       │
│    treated as part of the ADDMUL group and as a 3-operand          │
│    operation.                                                      │
│                                                                    │
│ This avoids changing the top-level module ports and keeps the      │
│ existing API stable.                                               │
