│                                                                    │
│  • fp_regular_status.NV = src_is_int_q & (of_before_round |        │
│    of_after_round);                                                │
│  • fp_regular_status.OF = ~src_is_int_q & ...                      │
│  • fp_regular_status.NX = src_is_int_q ? ... : ...                 │
│                                                                    │
│ These lines incorrectly classify overflow on I2F as invalid.       │
│                                                                    │
│               3) Best practices to take into account               │
│                                                                    │
│  • Make the fix minimal and local: only adjust exception flag      │
│    behavior, don’t alter unrelated datapath logic.                 │
