│     • floating-point to integer conversions,                       │
│     • NaN/Inf handling,                                            │
│     • non-overflow cases.                                          │
│  • Follow IEEE 754 exception mapping:                              │
│     • I2F overflow → OF (and likely NX if inexact),                │
│     • not NV.                                                      │
│  • Keep comments consistent with behavior so future readers do not │
│    get misled.                                                     │
│                                                                    │
