│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│                       1) What the problem is                       │
│                                                                    │
│ The simulation fails in ModelSim/Questa with:                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • vsim-3053: Illegal output or inout port connection for port     │
│    'slv_resp_o'                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ This means a module output port is being connected to something    │
│ that the simulator considers non-drivable / illegal in that        │
│ context. In this case, the issue occurs while instantiating        │
│ axi_err_slv inside the AXI crossbar.                               │
│                                                                    │
│                    2) Where the problem occurs                     │
│                                                                    │
│ The error points to axi_xbar.sv around the instantiation of        │
│ axi_err_slv:                                                       │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  .slv_resp_o ( slv_resps[i][Cfg.NoMstPorts] )                      │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ The signal slv_resps is declared as:                               │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  slv_resp_t [Cfg.NoSlvPorts-1:0][Cfg.NoMstPorts:0] slv_resps;      │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ Then the code also does crossbar wiring:                           │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  assign slv_resps[i][j] = mst_resps[j][i];                         │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ This is already suspicious because slv_resps[i][Cfg.NoMstPorts] is │
│ being driven by the axi_err_slv output, and the same array element │
│ may be treated in a way ModelSim does not like due to array        │
│ slicing / packed-unpacked direction semantics.                     │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue is in axi_xbar.sv, not in axi_err_slv.sv.                │
│                                                                    │
│               3) Best practices to take into account               │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep changes minimal and localized.                             │
│  • Avoid changing interface behavior unless necessary.             │
│  • Be careful with SystemVerilog packed vs. unpacked array         │
│    semantics when connecting module ports.                         │
│  • When a simulator complains about port direction legality, use   │
│    an intermediate signal if direct array element connection is    │
│    problematic.                                                    │
│  • Preserve synthesis-friendly structure.                          │
│                                                                    │
│                     4) How to fix the problem                      │
│                                                                    │
│ The safest fix is to introduce an intermediate wire for the error  │
│ slave response per slave-port instance, and then assign it into    │
│ the slv_resps array element.                                       │
│                                                                    │
│ This avoids direct output-port-to-array-element connection issues  │
│ that some simulators mishandle.                                    │
