│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│                       1) What the problem is                       │
│                                                                    │
│ The simulator error:                                               │
│                                                                    │
│  • Illegal output or inout port connection for port 'slv_resp_o'   │
│                                                                    │
│ means that a module port declared as an output is being connected  │
│ to a signal/net in a way that ModelSim/Questa 10.6c does not       │
│ accept in this context.                                            │
│                                                                    │
│ In this design, the error happens when instantiating axi_err_slv   │
│ inside the AXI crossbar. The problematic connection is on the      │
│ slv_resp_o port.                                                   │
│                                                                    │
│                    2) Where the problem occurs                     │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue is in src/axi_xbar.sv, at the instantiation of           │
│ axi_err_slv:                                                       │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  ) i_axi_err_slv (                                                 │
│    .clk_i,   // Clock                                              │
│    .rst_ni,  // Asynchronous reset active low                      │
│    .test_i,  // Testmode enable                                    │
│    // slave port                                                   │
│    .slv_req_i  ( slv_reqs[i][Cfg.NoMstPorts]   ),                  │
│    .slv_resp_o ( slv_resps[i][Cfg.NoMstPorts]  )                   │
│  );                                                                │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ The signal slv_resps[i][Cfg.NoMstPorts] is part of a               │
│ packed/unpacked array of structs used for interconnect routing,    │
│ and Questa 10.6c can reject such a direct output connection even   │
│ if the RTL is structurally correct.                                │
│                                                                    │
│               3) Best practices to take into account               │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep the fix minimal and avoid changing the AXI protocol logic. │
│  • Prefer a tool-compatible connection style rather than           │
│    redesigning the datapath.                                       │
│  • Preserve synthesis behavior and simulation semantics.           │
│  • Avoid broad changes to crossbar structure or type definitions   │
│    unless necessary.                                               │
│                                                                    │
│                     4) How to fix the problem                      │
│                                                                    │
│ A standard workaround for older SystemVerilog simulators is to     │
│ connect the module output to a temporary intermediate signal of    │
│ the same type, and then assign that temporary signal into the      │
│ array element.                                                     │
│                                                                    │
│ This avoids the simulator’s illegal port-connection complaint      │
│ while keeping the hardware behavior unchanged.                     │
