│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│               3) Best practices to take into account               │
│                                                                    │
│  • Avoid nondeterministic races between stimulus sources and       │
│    scoreboard/checking logic.                                      │
│  • Keep tests stable across seeds unless randomness is explicitly  │
│    part of the checked behavior.                                   │
│  • Restrict background stimuli so they do not interfere with       │
│    deterministic setup/initial validation.                         │
│  • Use synchronization or gating to ensure random activity starts  │
│    only after known-state checks are completed.                    │
│                                                                    │
