│                                                                    │
│  • generates random byte loads (toggle_load)                       │
│  • checks AXI read data (proc_check_read_data)                     │
│                                                                    │
│ The key interaction is:                                            │
│                                                                    │
│  • toggle_load() updates reg_d / reg_load                          │
│  • proc_check_read_data() builds expected read data from reg_q     │
│                                                                    │
│ Because these happen concurrently, reg_q may not reflect a stable  │
│ “written register value” during the read check.                    │
│                                                                    │
