│ against a stable expected value written by the test, rather than   │
│ the live register state potentially modified by toggle_load.       │
│                                                                    │
│ A minimal and robust approach:                                     │
│                                                                    │
│  • introduce a local expected value for the known register write,  │
│  • use that same value for the read assertion,                     │
│  • keep the random load stimulus unchanged.                        │
│                                                                    │
