│       slv_data_t r_data = slv_r_tran[t].data;                      │
│     • Write channel serialization around the block using automatic │
│       mst_data_t w_data = w_req_d.w.data;                          │
│  • src/axi_dw_downsizer.sv                                         │
│     • Read channel serialization around automatic slv_data_t       │
│       r_data = r_req_d.r.data;                                     │
│     • Write channel serialization around automatic mst_data_t      │
│       w_data = mst_req.w.data;                                     │
│                                                                    │
