│  • Replace typedef logic [1:0] burst_t;                            │
│  • with a width parameter and typedef logic [BurstWidth-1:0]       │
│    burst_t;                                                        │
│  • Set BurstWidth = 2                                              │
│                                                                    │
│ This is minimal and matches the suggested direction mentioned in   │
│ the issue.                                                         │
