│ The issue is in:                                                   │
│                                                                    │
│  • hw/carfield_pkg.sv                                              │
│                                                                    │
│ Specifically in the “Security Island Parameters” section:          │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  localparam string RomCtrlBootRomInitFile =                        │
│  "sw/security_island/bootrom/boot_rom.vmem";                       │
│  localparam string OtpCtrlMemInitFile     =                        │
│  "sw/security_island/otp/otp-img.mem";                             │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│                   3. Best practices to consider                    │
│                                                                    │
│  • Avoid synthesis-unsupported types such as string in package     │
│    parameters/constants that are included in synthesis.            │
│  • Prefer using synthesis-friendly types such as int, logic, or    │
│    plain compile-time constants.                                   │
│  • If the values are only used for simulation/testbench or         │
│    non-synthesized configuration, isolate them from                │
│    synthesis-visible code with synthesis guards.                   │
│  • Keep the fix minimal and targeted to preserve behavior          │
│    elsewhere.                                                      │
│                                                                    │
│                          4. How to fix it                          │
│                                                                    │
│ The simplest and most robust fix is to prevent these string        │
│ localparams from being compiled during synthesis, while preserving │
│ them for simulation and other non-synthesis flows.                 │
│                                                                    │
│ That can be done by wrapping those declarations with synthesis     │
│ guards such as:                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  `ifndef SYNTHESIS                                                 │
│    ...                                                             │
│  `endif                                                            │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ This way:                                                          │
│                                                                    │
│  • synthesis no longer sees unsupported string declarations,       │
│  • simulation retains the boot ROM and OTP image path constants.   │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│                                                                    │
│                    Phase 2: FIX IMPLEMENTATION                     │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  [file]hw/carfield_pkg.sv[/file]                                   │
│  [original]                                                        │
│  /******************************/                                  │
│  /* Security Island Parameters */                                  │
│  /******************************/                                  │
│  localparam string RomCtrlBootRomInitFile =                        │
│  "sw/security_island/bootrom/boot_rom.vmem";                       │
│  localparam string OtpCtrlMemInitFile     =                        │
│  "sw/security_island/otp/otp-img.mem";                             │
│  [/original]                                                       │
│  [patched]                                                         │
│  /******************************/                                  │
│  /* Security Island Parameters */                                  │
│  /******************************/                                  │
│  `ifndef SYNTHESIS                                                 │
│  localparam string RomCtrlBootRomInitFile =                        │
