1. Modify the top‐level Carfield SoC file where the L2 SPM is instantiated (`hw/carfield_soc.sv`).
2. Update the Carfield L2 SPM module if it needs new ports or changed AXI interfaces (`hw/l2_spm.sv`).
3. Flesh out or parameterize the atomic‐structs module itself if needed for the new port (`hw/axi_riscv_atomics_structs.sv`).
4. (Depending on how Carfield’s top is structured) ensure the wrapper ports are exposed/passed in the Carfield top-level script (`hw/carfield_top.sv`).

