│                                                                    │
│ the state machine should check this flag in WAIT_END_PERIOD and    │
│ skip the impossible counter comparison for div_q == 0.             │
│                                                                    │
│ A minimal and correct fix is:                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • if clk_div_bypass_en_q is asserted, go back to IDLE directly    │
│  • otherwise keep the existing cycle_cntr_q == div_q - 1 condition │
│                                                                    │
│ This preserves normal behavior and fixes the deadlock for divider  │
│ 0.                                                                 │
│                                                                    │
